  "version": "2026.11-1",
  "description": "Curated map from the product a service declares (docs/18 §5) to its NVD CPE vendor:product (docs/19 §3). Patterns are case-insensitive and must match the whole product name: no fuzzy matching. versionConfidence is how far the version of that source can be trusted: HIGH (protocol banner) allows a CONFIRMED_VULNERABILITY, MEDIUM (HTTP/RTSP Server header, easy to change or generic) at most a POTENTIAL_RISK. A product never matches on the vendor alone.",
